cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the benchmark results, please cite it as below."
title: "Cross-cohort multi-omic integration benchmark in gynaecological tumours"
abstract: >-
  Code, figures, tables and a verification harness for a methodological benchmark
  of cross-cohort multi-omic integration. The package evaluates whether adding
  omics layers improves cross-cohort transfer, whether the identity of the best
  integration method is a resolvable claim, and where multi-omic integration is
  fragile. It ships two independent toolchains, two orthogonal perturbation
  designs, a geometric figure checker and an automated number-tracing harness.
type: software
